# Data cache — publish the small per-symbol CSVs at local_data root;
# deny ALL subdirectories by default (Kraken_batch 32G, Kraken_funding_rates 436M,
# holdout_sealed 1.9G sealed). Deny-by-default, not name enumeration: a new bulk
# directory added later is caught automatically.
trading-bot/local_data/*/
# Belt-and-braces: the single-use holdout must never become publishable
**/holdout_sealed/
# Exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file hard limit — would reject the push
trading-bot/local_data/BTCUSDT_1m.csv

# Agent config / transcripts
.claude/
strategy-research/.claude/

